*	 [ロゴの下に表示するメッセージ(UNIX版は29文字まで)  ]
#comment=   ------- for Mac OS X --------
*#comment=   ------ for Linux / OSS ------
*#comment=   ----- for FreeBSD / OSS -----
*#comment=   -------- for  NetBSD --------
*#comment=   --------- for SunOS ---------
*#comment=   -------- for Solaris --------
